@startuml
allowmixing
!pragma layout smetana
set namespaceSeparator none
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #45627B
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EEF5FB
skinparam classBorderColor #45627B
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #FAFCFE
hide empty members
title OpenRocket engine ↔ flight-computer integration

top to bottom direction
package "Existing OpenRocket simulation" {
 class Simulation
 interface SimulationEngine
 class BasicEventSimulationEngine
 class ModifiedEventSimulationEngine
 interface SimulationStepper
 class RK4SimulationStepper
 class SimulationStatus
 class SimulationConditions
 class FlightDataBranch
 class SimulationListenerHelper
 interface SimulationListener
 abstract class AbstractSimulationListener
}
package "FC integration" {
 class ZephyrusFlightComputer <<extension>> {
  prepareDesign()
  initialize(conditions)
 }
 class FlightControllerSimulatorListener {
  startSimulation(status)
  preStep(status)
  postStep(status)
  dispatch(bootUs)
  endSimulation(status, error)
 }
 class RTFC
 class RTSimulationCommunicator
 class FlightComputerRecoveryBridge
}
Simulation --> SimulationEngine : simulate
SimulationEngine <|.. BasicEventSimulationEngine
SimulationEngine <|.. ModifiedEventSimulationEngine
SimulationStepper <|.. RK4SimulationStepper
BasicEventSimulationEngine --> SimulationStepper : advances physics
ModifiedEventSimulationEngine --> SimulationStepper : advances physics
SimulationStatus --> SimulationConditions
SimulationStatus --> FlightDataBranch : records samples
SimulationConditions o-- SimulationListener
SimulationListener <|.. AbstractSimulationListener
AbstractSimulationListener <|-- FlightControllerSimulatorListener
SimulationListenerHelper --> SimulationListener : dispatches callbacks
BasicEventSimulationEngine --> SimulationListenerHelper
ModifiedEventSimulationEngine --> SimulationListenerHelper
ZephyrusFlightComputer --> FlightControllerSimulatorListener : installs one per run
FlightControllerSimulatorListener *-- RTFC : fresh boot
FlightControllerSimulatorListener *-- RTSimulationCommunicator
FlightControllerSimulatorListener *-- FlightComputerRecoveryBridge
FlightControllerSimulatorListener --> SimulationStatus : accepted truth + deadlines
RTSimulationCommunicator --> SimulationStatus : per-run rocket actuators
FlightComputerRecoveryBridge --> BasicEventSimulationEngine : queued deployment events
FlightComputerRecoveryBridge --> ModifiedEventSimulationEngine : queued deployment events
note bottom of FlightControllerSimulatorListener
The extension's legacy class name is retained.
The firmware root package is edu.mit.rocket_team.
No unrelated AirbrakesControllerListener is used.
end note

@enduml
